{
  "_note": "The project workflow the fixture transport emulates: statuses, the initial status of a new issue, and the transitions (from '*' = any). Regenerated by `ticket-store-jira.sh --live --record` from the real project (GET /rest/api/3/project/<KEY>/statuses + the transitions seen during the recorded lifecycle) so the fake cannot drift from the API. `users` is what /rest/api/3/user/search answers for the roster's emails.",
  "initial": "To Do",
